cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "contribution_extraction_framework: Multi-Agent Contribution Extraction with Verifiable Grounding"
abstract: >
  A three-agent (Extractor + Critic + Consolidator) pipeline for extracting
  (Method, Task, Dataset, Metric) tuples from scientific papers, with
  self-consistency voting and temperature-scaled confidence calibration.
  Default deployment uses open-weights LLMs (DeepSeek Chat, Llama 3.3 70B);
  a specialized variant uses a LoRA fine-tuned Llama 3.1 70B extractor.
type: software
